 RIR2\nIncline dumbbell press 3×8–10 @RIR2\nChest-supported row 3×8–1
 0 @RIR2\nLateral raise 3×12–15 @RIR1\nCable/machine fly 2×10–12 @RIR
 1\nTriceps pushdown 2×10–12 @RIR1\nPallof press (per kant) 2×10–12 @
 RIR2
