DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261112
SUMMARY:Kracht: Lower A zonder squat/RDL
DESCRIPTION:Leg press i.p.v. squat\; geen RDL deze week.\nLeg press 3×8
 –10 @RIR2\nBulgarian split squat (per been) 3×8 @RIR3\nHamstring curl 2
 ×10–12 @RIR2\nStaande calf raise 3×10–15 @RIR1\nTibialis raise 2×15
 –20 @RIR1\nCopenhagen plank (sec per kant) 2×20–30 @RIR2\nDead bug (p
 er kant) 2×8 @RIR2
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
