SUMMARY:Kracht: Upper B + core
DESCRIPTION:Volledig bovenlichaam.\nPull-up (+ extra kg) 4×5–8 @RIR2\nS
 houlder press (staand/zittend) 3×6–8 @RIR2\nSingle-arm cable row (per k
 ant) 3×10–12 @RIR2\nRear delt fly 3×12–15 @RIR1\nIncline dumbbell cu
 rl 2×10–12 @RIR1\nHammer curl 2×10–12 @RIR1\nSuitcase carry (meter p
 er kant) 3×30–40 @RIR2\nHanging knee raise 3×10–15 @RIR2
